From 5f63dd5696b015b2f10c14cc3b205b59b805c6bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Subbu Vakati <subbusrv@amazon.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 22:00:06 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Bump Go deps to fix CVEs

- go 1.25.0 -> 1.26.0 (drop toolchain go1.25.10); x/net 0.60+ requires go 1.26
- google.golang.org/grpc v1.72.1 -> v1.83.2
- go.opentelemetry.io/otel, otel/sdk -> v1.44.0 (required by grpc v1.83.2)
- golang.org/x/net -> v0.61.0, x/text -> v0.43.0, x/sys -> v0.49.0,
  x/oauth2 -> v0.37.0, plus the other golang.org/x modules to latest
---
 go.mod | 40 ++++++++++++++----------------
 go.sum | 78 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----------------------------
 2 files changed, 59 insertions(+), 59 deletions(-)

